{"version":1,"key":"card:720","content":{"id":720,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a4224282-655c-49d0-9e73-c89c8fbcb44e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"人类经过了几千年的发展，为什么始终维持在刚好吃饱的水平？技术带来的生产效率提升和粮食增加，似乎总是被人口增长给消耗掉。英国经济学家、人口学家托马斯·马尔萨斯在 1798 年的《人口论》中提出了这个政治经济学概念，他将"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"人类生活水平长期停滞"},{"type":"formatted","text":"的现象称为马尔萨斯陷阱。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d6aa0fa9-c56e-4f0d-a61c-b5707e77c6db","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"马尔萨斯陷阱建立在两个假设之上："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"66063661-2f4f-4af0-ac94-b8b2bc078a0f","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bf6ddb2a-39b5-4b6d-9949-7f718ad79961","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"49a3bd9b-79fd-4812-b9ed-9d19f3d7913e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"人口增长：人口的增长速率是乘性的，数量呈指数增长的趋势"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e231772e-84ab-4a69-ae02-bc2f9d336fa3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8cd6cff6-5f1f-4eae-9e8c-d70d7464b269","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"粮食增长：粮食的增长是线性的，受到土地面积和地力的限制，粮食只能线性增长"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0e0b5b2a-f565-454e-af9f-fd4b079e4093","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当技术爆发带来粮食增长时，人口随之暴增，消耗掉所有的资源，甚至超过粮食能供给的水平，导致贫困。这时自然和社会会出现一些抑制机制，比如瘟疫、战争、晚婚晚育等来抑制人口数量，使得人口与粮食供给重新达到平衡。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fe582acc-2f22-4242-8d78-bb623387f0f9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但在现代社会，我们可以观察到马尔萨斯陷阱被打破了，人类的生活水平有了极大的提高，因为他的两个假设都不再成立："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"885333e4-be23-43a9-97e4-7aaf7b14d79b","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"51328d51-a1ff-4108-be0f-696ce464e432","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2a1a8ab6-b149-405e-b857-ea81dcb5c51d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"人口增长：当社会经济、教育水平（特别是女性教育水平）提高时，人们的生育意愿会降低，甚至出现负增长，指数增长的假设不存在"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4b7112a0-4c40-4c0b-96a3-8e75baba9cec","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e548a2c1-fe40-43e9-887e-0b7e6859790f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"粮食增长：随着化肥、农药、机械化和生物技术（培育出高产的农作物），粮食不再是线性增长，而是爆发性的增长"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0bd87691-3aef-43f0-8af7-711ed9c99ff2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不过，如果我们把视角从粮食扩展到资源，马尔萨斯的警示在现代依然有意义。地球的资源是有限的，如果人类不控制对资源的无限渴求，就可能导致生态崩溃，陷入另一种形式的马尔萨斯陷阱。"}]}],"tags":["概念","经济/马尔萨斯陷阱"],"createTime":1778988782824,"updateTime":1778990035052,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1778990035052}}